# Engine outputs (regenerated each run)
data/*.json
# ...except the trade ledger: source-of-truth P&L data, not regenerable.
# (Holds no secrets — positions and prices only.)
!data/trades.json

# The signal log is accumulated observation, not a regenerable artifact:
# every row is a market state that existed once and cannot be recomputed
# later. Doc 010 invariant 2 requires historical datasets stay version
# controlled, and the 2026-08-08 container recycle proved that anything
# gitignored is one restart from gone. Committed deliberately.
# (Holds no secrets — signal values and public prices only.)
!data/signal_log.jsonl
